  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved energy efficiency as a means to increase access to affordable and reliable electricity &#x2013; 2024-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has the overall objective to objective of improving continental energy efficiency as a means to increase access to affordable and reliable energy in Africa. Through the APPS, Denmark will provide DKK 15 million towards this goal during 2024-2028.</narrative>
  </description>
